WEBVTT

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.660
<i>There are zombies everywhere.</i>

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:28.460
I don't see any people in any of the houses.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.090
I wonder if everyone in the fishing 
village turned into zombies.

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.890
<i>That is highly likely.</i>

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.760
Well... What to do?

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:45.250
I never thought I'd run into zombies while 
trying to find the Palace of the Dragon King.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:49.360
Hm... Should I just burn 
down the whole village?

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.730
But if there <i>is</i> anyone left alive...

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>Cayna!</i>

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:57.870
I know.

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:47.020
<b>A Butler, a Ghost Ship, a Ward, and the Palace of the Dragon King</b>

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:47.020
<b>A Butler, a Ghost Ship, a Ward, and the Palace of the Dragon King</b>

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:49.560
Wh-Whoa, hold on a sec!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:53.500
I'm human! Don't attack!

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:55.400
All right.

00:02:56.070 --> 00:03:01.030
<i>Level 430. She's definitely a player.</i>

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:01.030
<b>Quolkeh    Human</b>

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.750
Are you the one who caused the tragedy here?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:09.460
No way! We got trapped in this fog, too, 
and we were trying to figure out what to do.

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.040
"We"?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.670
Yeah, my buddy's nearby.

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:15.390
Hey, wait. You're...

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:19.050
<i>Why do I feel like I've met her before?</i>

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.840
We met at the Adventurers' Guild in Helshper.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:31.350
Oh, that's right. So your buddy's the 
dragoid you were with in Helshper?

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:34.270
Yeah, him. I'll take you to him.

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:39.310
If you lead me into a trap, I'm going 
to blow this whole place apart.

00:03:39.310 --> 00:03:41.290
What the hell kind of threat is that?!

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:44.820
Also, you can't blow this 
place up. There's a survivor.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:45.840
Huh?

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.250
A storehouse...

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.160
Missy?

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:03.060
Exis, someone got in here 
after all... my dear.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:06.220
Er... It's the adventurer 
we ran into in Helshper.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:11.520
She's probably a player. She may even 
be stronger than... me, my dear.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:15.060
You seem to be talking 
differently all of a sudden.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:20.510
Sh-Shut up, dear. There's just 
a lot... going on right now.

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:22.210
Such as what?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:28.240
You've got some nerve trying to 
attack another species, lizard.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:31.330
Er, I was just trying to confirm something...

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.070
That sword, your strength...

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:38.340
I can't see your level, 
so you must be higher than me.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:41.420
Meaning you must be Cayna!

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:52.310
Xxxxxxxxxxx?

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:52.310
<b>Dragoid</b>

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:56.700
Unfortunately, I don't know anyone 
with a name as unique as yours.

00:04:56.700 --> 00:05:01.860
You probably won't recognize me in 
this form, but Exis is my second account.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.440
My main one is Tartarus.

00:05:03.950 --> 00:05:06.220
Tar...tarus?

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.810
Tarta...

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.240
Tartar Sauce!

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.230
Tch. I knew you were going to call me that.

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:15.820
Oh, it's been forever! Tartar Sauce!

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:18.790
Yep, you're Cayna, all right. 
I'm impressed you're still alive.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:22.570
This is Cayna. She was in the 
Cream Cheese guild with me.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:27.930
When Tartar Sauce was in the guild, he was 
a scrawny player who mostly used magic.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:34.200
And that's why I created another character,
 a strong dragoid fighter.

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.580
Oh, I see.

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:40.110
Well, shit... I mean, I'm Quolkeh.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:44.610
If you belonged to Cream Cheese, 
are you also one of those OP Skill Masters?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:45.870
Yup.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:50.870
Man, thank goodness you didn't 
kill me earlier... my dear.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:54.230
Quolkeh, are you actually a guy?

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:58.330
W-Well, you know. Stuff happens.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:01.300
So when did you end up in Leadale?

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:03.550
About two months ago.

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:06.160
That's pretty recent. 
We've been here two years.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:08.340
What brought you to this village?

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.290
I'm looking for the Palace 
of the Dragon King.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:11.680
The Palace of the Dragon King?

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.280
It's a Guardian Tower.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:14.640
And it's here?

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.310
Probably. What are you two doing here?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:21.160
We're here on a quest 
from Helshper... my dear.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.110
A quest?

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.650
They said there weren't any fish 
coming in to market from the sea,

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:27.900
so we checked out a different 
fishing village first.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:31.030
But there was no one there.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:36.580
So we kept going south, 
and when we got to this village...

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:40.120
There was this strange fog 
and zombies everywhere.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.380
Apparently, if you touch the fog,
 you turn into a zombie.

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:44.970
A fog?

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:48.120
It might be because we're 
players, but we're fine.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:51.860
Then we were attacked by former villagers.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:53.820
We killed many, but they 
kept coming, so we came here

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.690
because we didn't have the 
foggiest idea what to do.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:56.980
I see what you did there.

00:06:56.980 --> 00:06:57.780
What?

00:06:57.780 --> 00:07:00.730
Nothing. Never mind.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:06.900
We took shelter here and found a 
survivor... so, yeah... my dear.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:11.430
You can probably stop trying 
so hard to sound feminine.

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:13.670
You sound way more awkward than you think.

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:17.950
So, where's this survivor?

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:19.660
Right over there.

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:28.170
Her name is Luka.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.510
Luka...

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:33.110
Wh-What the hell is that?!

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.510
It's my Li'l Fairy.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.680
Li'l Fairy?

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:38.680
Opus gave her to me.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:42.850
Or maybe I should say he left her in my care.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:48.520
Opus?! That stupid asshole's 
in this world, too?

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:52.330
I haven't run into him, 
so I'm not sure if he is or not.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:55.940
Who's Opus?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.950
An idiot we got stuck with.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.440
A stupid asshole who always 
got us into trouble.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.580
Oh, I see...

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:08.000
Well, anyway... Even if we 
try to get her out of here,

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.380
she might turn into a zombie 
if she touches the fog.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:16.930
So the cause of the fog must 
be a monster or something.

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:20.760
Getting rid of that will probably 
be the quickest solution.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:21.560
Yeah.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.090
Well, we'll just do that. 
You keep an eye on her, Cayna.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:29.310
I'll go, too. You can use 
all the help you can get.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:30.480
Yeah, but...

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:33.380
We shouldn't leave her all alone, either.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.330
Then let's do this.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:42.180
Why do you have two of those?!

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:45.290
That's just how much I played the game.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.590
You damn shut-in.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.020
I'll take that as a compliment, thanks.

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:53.540
Sorry, I have no idea what 
you two are talking about.

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:55.260
Oh, sorry.

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:59.440
This is something you get after you 
play the game for 10,000 hours.

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:01.600
T-Ten thousand hours?!

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:07.190
And since she's got two of them, 
she's played at least 20,000 hours.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.810
Shut-in confirmed.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:11.610
Members of Cream Cheese 
sure are something else.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.780
Your level of shut-in is,
 like, on another level.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:18.070
Now I'll be able to summon 
a butler or a maid.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:21.720
And you're going to have them 
watch over this little girl.

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:27.960
Correct. But I wonder if 
I should summon Cie or Rox.

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:30.630
If at all possible, don't summon that maid.

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.400
Huh?

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:32.750
Okay, then.

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:05.060
It's been too long, Master.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:07.290
I have come in response to your summons.

00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:11.200
Your every wish is my command.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.880
Hey, Roxilius. How have you been?

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:20.050
I'm not entirely sure how 
to answer that question.

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:24.010
Where's Roxine? You weren't together?

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:28.780
I have no idea where that 
failure of a cat is.

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:29.600
I see.

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:33.520
This is Roxilius, my wonderful servant.

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:37.490
I am Roxilius, the werecat butler.

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:42.700
I have much to work on, 
but your wish is my command.

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:44.090
R-Right...

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:45.300
Nice to meet you.

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:48.250
We're gonna go take care of some monsters.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:51.650
Could you look after this 
little girl named Luka?

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:54.220
Yes, as you wish.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:58.260
I, Roxilius, shall protect Miss Luka.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.820
All right, let's go.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:04.870
Wait. Village, fog, and zombies?

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:08.500
Kee, search for quests 
that match those words.

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.980
I'm pretty sure I've seen this before.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.610
<i>Understood.</i>

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:17.480
<i>We have a hit.</i>

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.240
Thanks, Kee!

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:22.330
I figured out what quest this is.

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:22.910
Huh?

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:26.160
In order to clear this quest, 
we need to defeat the boss.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:30.830
The boss is the Ghost Ship and the 
pirate captain named Terror Skeleton.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:38.780
All right, let's get to cleaning all this up.

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:42.010
Miss Luka, that's my...

00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:44.550
Poke, poke. Tail? So fluffy.

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:48.750
Now, let's begi—

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:56.740
So, what are we supposed to do?

00:11:56.740 --> 00:12:00.180
I think we just need to set the Ghost Ship
 and the pirate captain on fire.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:01.930
You don't hold back, do you?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:06.240
Better than letting some other 
village fall prey to them.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:07.930
Well, yeah...

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:08.740
Look.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:21.260
Well, let's do this thing.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:25.160
If we don't defeat the pirate captain 
at the core of the Ghost Ship first,

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:28.100
he'll continue to use the souls of the 
villagers who got turned into zombies

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.700
as fuel to infinitely revive.

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:32.140
Meaning it'll be a never-ending battle.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.050
Ah, so it's that kind of quest.

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:36.440
All right, then.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:39.900
In that case, Cayna and Quolkeh, 
take care of all the small fry.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.160
Got it!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.110
I'll take care of the boss!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.580
Here we go!

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:04.880
I have no idea what you're saying!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:08.200
Take this, Terror Skeleton!

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:11.810
He did it.

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.600
That was fast.

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:47.020
Well, considering the difference 
in levels, what did you expect?

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:50.350
This is gonna be a pain 
to report to the guild.

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:54.270
What's gonna happen to the fishing village?
 It's just gonna be a ruin now?

00:13:54.270 --> 00:14:01.650
Well, no one will want to live in a village 
that got wiped out for some reason.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.670
I'm sure the kingdom can take care of that.

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.070
Yeah.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:09.040
Heigl, we avenged you.

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:14.290
You had a companion?

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.790
Not exactly a companion, 
but a summoned beast.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:20.140
We were suddenly attacked in this fog, 
and he ended up disappearing.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:21.970
I thought you were talking about a person!

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:25.380
Don't make things so confusing! 
What got defeated?

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:28.800
A centaur, level 250.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.280
I'm pretty sure you'll be able to 
summon him again after ten days!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:38.810
Well, yeah... So anyway, 
what should we do about Luka?

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.450
Well, she might want to stay here.

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:46.360
Isn't it dangerous for a kid 
to stay here alone... my dear?

00:15:01.100 --> 00:15:02.260
Why don't you sit?

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:04.500
I humbly decline, as I am an on-duty butler.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:06.550
Master...

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.580
Oh, did I wake you?

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:14.950
Are you okay?

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.640
You can sleep a little longer if you want.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:21.970
Here you are.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:36.790
Cayna's offered to take you in.
What do you wanna do?

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:40.810
Do you want to stay in the village 
alone or come with us instead?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.710
I see.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:55.670
We can be a family. We don't have to 
rush things. We can take our time.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.870
Okay. Sorry, Luka.

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:16.830
I need to take care of something real 
quick. Wait here with them, okay?

00:16:17.480 --> 00:16:18.240
Okay...

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.660
Keep an eye on Luka for me.

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:23.570
Indeed! Even if it costs me my li—

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.080
If something did happen to you,

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:29.070
Luka would have to witness 
whatever tragedy that is!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:34.680
Protect Luka, no matter what, 
without dying. Okay?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.010
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:39.030
She's already doting on the kid.

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:40.470
So...

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:43.640
Why did you summon a blue dragon?

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:47.090
I can't swim, so I thought 
I'd have the dragon take me there.

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.940
I see.

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:51.360
Okay, I'll be back.

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.560
<i>There's the Palace of the Dragon King.</i>

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:34.350
Go see if there's a mermaid 
village around here somewhere.

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:38.830
<i>Now, then...</i>

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.050
I wonder if that's this tower's core.

00:18:02.130 --> 00:18:03.070
Hup.

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:06.980
I'll share some of my MP with you.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:20.010
Finally, the third one.

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:23.360
I've still got nine more... 
Man, this is gonna take forever.

00:18:24.020 --> 00:18:27.390
Excuse me, are you a guest?

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:29.680
Oh, are you the Guardian... here?!

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.950
<i>That's not an enemy. That's not 
an enemy. That's not an enemy.</i>

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:39.380
<i>That's not an enemy. That's not 
an enemy. It's an ally...</i>

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:42.300
A-Are you the Guardian here?

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:48.980
Oh, yes. I'm the Guardian 
of Skill Master Number Six.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:54.150
I-I see. I'm Skill Master Number Three, Cayna.

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:57.420
I came here to activate the tower.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:01.970
I'm sorry I'm not Liothek, 
but you'll just have to settle for me.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:11.580
Oh, it's fine. I figured my master 
would not return here again.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:20.510
Does this mean you're my master now?

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:23.340
S-Sure, I guess.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:24.970
Okay.

00:19:36.660 --> 00:19:40.320
<i>Thank goodness it's not sticky or slimy.</i>

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:43.770
Thanks. I'll happily accept.

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:46.910
You can get more details from 
Wall Face back at my tower.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.660
Okay.

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:56.040
How'd it go?

00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:02.120
<i>I see. I guess we won't find it that easily.</i>

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:23.740
Okay, friend requests accepted.

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.660
<b>Friends List</b>

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.660
<b>Shining Saber</b>

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.660
<b>Cohral</b>

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:26.660
<b>Quolkeh</b>

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:26.660
That finally makes four players.

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:30.330
I only have you and Quolkeh.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:35.880
Well, I'm sure you two plan on 
wandering around more than me, right?

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.930
If you run into anyone, let me know.

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:41.050
What are you going to do?

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:43.250
Well, now that I've got a foster family,

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:46.720
I'm gonna take it easy in 
the village near my tower.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:47.740
Village?

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:50.330
There's a place that takes good care of me.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:53.640
If anything happens, 
send me a friend message.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.420
Okay, got it.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:57.330
Hey.

00:20:58.360 --> 00:20:59.430
Take care.

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:00.480
See you later.

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:02.770
O-Okay...

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:07.950
All right, I'll send you back to Helshper.

00:21:08.190 --> 00:21:11.620
Exis, Quolkeh, be careful out there.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:13.120
Same to you.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.290
See you later, Cayna.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:34.270
I'm sure those two will be fine, and we'll 
probably run into them again sometime.

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:35.300
Mm...

00:21:35.300 --> 00:21:37.190
Okay, Luka. Let's go.

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:41.650
I'll show you around the royal capital 
of Felskeilo and the village, too.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:44.840
There's a little girl named 
Lytt back at the village.

00:21:44.840 --> 00:21:47.740
I'm sure you'll be great friends.
